---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="找不到這格影像"
  description="這個網址沒有對應的 CC18 影格內容；請返回最新作品、站內搜尋或首頁。"
  robots="noindex,follow"
>
  <section class="not-found-page" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <div class="not-found-frame" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>FRAME</span>
      <strong>404</strong>
      <i>NO SIGNAL</i>
    </div>
    <div class="not-found-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">MISSING FRAME</p>
      <h1 id="not-found-title">這個番號不在片單裡</h1>
      <p>網址可能已變更，或這部作品還沒有公開影評。你可以從最新作品重新選片，或直接用番號、演員與題材搜尋。</p>
      <div class="not-found-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/latest/">查看最新作品</a>
        <a class="button dark" href="/search/">搜尋番號或標籤</a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/">回到首頁 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
